{
  "_comment": [
    "Closed concept vocabulary. Seeded by hand; the LLM classifies INTO this list and never",
    "invents a concept. Anything it cannot place is returned as null (UNMAPPED), which is a",
    "valid and expected output.",
    "",
    "`aliases` doubles as the keyword list for LEXICAL matching. A lexical hit requires an",
    "alias AND the literal old value in the same segment - that co-occurrence rule is what",
    "stops 'clause 63' matching a retirement-age change. Do not relax it.",
    "",
    "`direction` tells the impact engine whether a value is a legal minimum (FLOOR) or a cap",
    "(CEILING). It is how we decide whether an internal value that differs from the new legal",
    "value is non-compliant or merely more generous."
  ],

  "concepts": [
